name: sim.stopSimulation
description: Requests a stop of the running simulation
luaSynopsis: sim.stopSimulation(bool wait = False)
pythonSynopsis: sim.stopSimulation(bool wait = false)
inputs:
1. wait: if true, will wait until the simulation state is sim.simulation_stopped, otherwise only triggers a stop request. If true, calling script cannot be the main- or a simulation script, and should run threaded.
outputs:
